Z||000000||Cooter||09-03-2001||11:02 PM||||One of my latest projects is the restoration of a 1963 Thunderbird. The car was in good running condition when parked about 20 years ago, but those years in the weather have not been kind. If anyone has a friend/neighbor/relative with an idea of where I can find a hood, front/rear bumpers and A/C compressor+brackets that fit the 390 engine, I would really appreciate it. ||||reg||9
