Z||000002||Cooter||09-04-2001||10:26 PM||||Thanks for the support! The car was in great condition when the guy quit driving it- he bought a new car because he felt the T-bird was worn out. It has a whopping 66,000 miles on it. While out in the pasture, the flat tires let it sink down to the ground and rust the lower portions and it has been hit by the tractor a couple of times. Hopefully there are some good pieces around because this car is too nice to junk out.||||reg||1
